{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"viewer/fold.css","issuer":"urn:lobby:seat:personal-qualifier-adoption-goal","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-31T01:20:59.067099Z","id":"64c01a27b47c0c0cd2658a42efc3a633dcabfdca5bbb7be6eb2b61bf11dd1867","body":{"detail":"Before 140c3de (#14) the act button (Sign) set color:var(--bg). No rule defined --bg, so the text fell back and measured 1.66:1 to 2.00:1 against the accent fill, under WCAG's 4.5:1 for text.","kind":"concern","ref":"git:ad9f51c","span":{"start":{"line":52},"end":{"line":52},"content_hash":"05d31cc4afef7ce9d29f534d218d677a15d88d37720eb6fb66f6cb150d5678d7"},"suggested_fix":"use a defined role (var(--paper)) and prove the pair from tokens","summary":"the act button's text colour was var(--bg), a custom property never defined (contrast 1.66-2.00:1)","tags":["a11y","contrast","backfill","session:claude-code:a712ec59-2921-4f38-93dd-4df60dcd1593"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"viewer/theme.tokens.json","issuer":"urn:lobby:seat:personal-qualifier-adoption-goal","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-31T01:20:59.067148Z","id":"873975323132a12592a06b59951373869b2d36124d006db6c3830de72ad3f65d","body":{"detail":"Found by the Rust contrast proof in tests/contrast.rs (every_role_pair_clears_its_minimum_in_every_mode) when 9273051 (#16) added it. The line/card and line/paper pairs are UI contrast (min 3) in viewer/theme.tokens.json:15-16.","kind":"concern","ref":"git:140c3de","span":{"start":{"line":50},"end":{"line":50},"content_hash":"4ac0a366f194379f4e7748fb94197cf914bdf1af65a8bfaca82a7f7607f10a51"},"suggested_fix":"take brand stone #888374, the light mode's line (3.64 and 4.33)","summary":"dark --line (#5C6B63) was 2.45:1 on card and 2.92:1 on paper, under 3:1 for the search box's border","tags":["a11y","contrast","backfill","session:claude-code:a712ec59-2921-4f38-93dd-4df60dcd1593"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"viewer/fold.css","issuer":"urn:lobby:seat:personal-qualifier-adoption-goal","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-31T01:20:59.067175Z","id":"74cd2b5f2287925a46fd19cc7a2d4a3af3e9908e40082029332ed5978faccd43","body":{"detail":"Under forced-colors the background becomes the user's Canvas, so a button marked only by its fill loses its edge. Both form.reading button (viewer/fold.css:28) and li.act button had border:0 before 5ede57a (#17).","kind":"concern","ref":"git:9273051","span":{"start":{"line":52},"end":{"line":52},"content_hash":"05d31cc4afef7ce9d29f534d218d677a15d88d37720eb6fb66f6cb150d5678d7"},"suggested_fix":"a border in the fill colour, which the system repaints; never set forced-color-adjust","summary":"buttons had border:0, so under forced-colors a fill alone left no visible edge","tags":["a11y","forced-colors","backfill","session:claude-code:a712ec59-2921-4f38-93dd-4df60dcd1593"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"viewer/fold.css","issuer":"urn:lobby:seat:personal-qualifier-adoption-goal","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-31T01:20:59.097439Z","id":"470448a7c00c03bba677f278af5b6671b65ae8ab7e2507231b69b63e31abab1e","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:140c3de","span":{"start":{"line":52},"end":{"line":52},"content_hash":"05d31cc4afef7ce9d29f534d218d677a15d88d37720eb6fb66f6cb150d5678d7"},"summary":"fixed in 140c3de (#14): color:var(--paper), a defined role; check.yml green at 140c3de (run 41149553826). Since 9273051 (#16), tests/contrast.rs fold_css_carries_the_tokens_and_no_colour_of_its_own refuses any colour drawn with a role no contrast pair covers, so an undefined --bg fails the build","supersedes":"64c01a27b47c0c0cd2658a42efc3a633dcabfdca5bbb7be6eb2b61bf11dd1867","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:a712ec59-2921-4f38-93dd-4df60dcd1593"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"viewer/theme.tokens.json","issuer":"urn:lobby:seat:personal-qualifier-adoption-goal","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-31T01:20:59.097494Z","id":"428908ed06a659b9364fdecafb180ba6d42bee048cc0970c14c6212ee06f8aa7","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:9273051","span":{"start":{"line":50},"end":{"line":50},"content_hash":"4ac0a366f194379f4e7748fb94197cf914bdf1af65a8bfaca82a7f7607f10a51"},"summary":"fixed in 9273051 (#16): dark line is {primitive.stone} #888374, 3.64:1 on card and 4.33:1 on paper; tests/contrast.rs every_role_pair_clears_its_minimum_in_every_mode passes; check.yml green at 9273051 (run 41149932665)","supersedes":"873975323132a12592a06b59951373869b2d36124d006db6c3830de72ad3f65d","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:a712ec59-2921-4f38-93dd-4df60dcd1593"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"viewer/fold.css","issuer":"urn:lobby:seat:personal-qualifier-adoption-goal","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-31T01:20:59.097532Z","id":"88eebc5522f021a160780e200273d67ce64a2774226d6db0ac7ed6cb37434d5e","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:5ede57a","span":{"start":{"line":52},"end":{"line":52},"content_hash":"05d31cc4afef7ce9d29f534d218d677a15d88d37720eb6fb66f6cb150d5678d7"},"summary":"fixed in 5ede57a (#17): both buttons take border:1px solid var(--accent); tests/contrast.rs fold_css_keeps_an_edge_wherever_it_fills_and_never_opts_out_of_forced_colors passes; check.yml green at 5ede57a (run 41151723498)","supersedes":"74cd2b5f2287925a46fd19cc7a2d4a3af3e9908e40082029332ed5978faccd43","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:a712ec59-2921-4f38-93dd-4df60dcd1593"]}}
